{"question_id": "07b6f563", "hypothesis": "Based on our previous conversation, here are some useful accessories for your iPhone 13 Pro:\n\n## 1. Screen Protector\nSince you mentioned needing to replace a cracked screen protector, here are some top options:\n\n- **Zagg InvisibleShield** \u2014 Known for durability and scratch resistance\n- **TechArmor** \u2014 Offers high-definition clarity with scratch and drop resistance\n- **Belkin** \u2014 Features anti-glare and fingerprint resistance\n- **BodyGuardz** \u2014 Available in tempered glass and screen armor variants\n- **Skinomi** \u2014 Focuses on clarity and durability\n\n## 2. Phone Wallet Case\nYou were also looking for a wallet case. Some great options include:\n\n- **Nomad** \u2014 Premium leather construction, stylish and durable\n- **Bellroy** \u2014 Slim and stylish design with premium materials\n- **Incipio** \u2014 Features RFID-blocking material and durable TPU construction\n- **Case-Mate** \u2014 Includes card slots and cash storage\n- **Mophie** \u2014 Offers wireless charging compatibility (great if you're getting a wireless charging power bank!)\n\n## 3. Wireless Charging Power Bank\nYou expressed interest in a wireless charging power bank for the convenience of cable-free charging. Based on your preferences, I'd recommend:\n\n- **Mophie** \u2014 Premium quality with wireless charging compatibility\n- **EcoFlow** \u2014 Offers fast charging, wireless charging, and high-capacity batteries\n- **EC Technology** \u2014 Features fast charging, wireless charging, and compact design\n\nWhen shopping for a wireless charging power bank, remember to look for:\n- **Qi certification** from the Wireless Power Consortium\n- **High capacity** (measured in mAh) for multiple charges\n- **Fast charging support** (QuickCharge, VOOC, or PD)\n- **Safety features** like overcharge and short-circuit protection\n- **Compact design** for portability\n\nSince you already have a", "verdict": "yes", "question_type": "single-session-preference"}
